    "confidence": "low",
    "plain": "This \u00a336 billion transport plan could reduce travel costs and support regional growth over time, but almost all the spending is planned for 2029\u20132040, and there are serious questions about whether the funding is genuinely new. The effect on ordinary households' cost of living is too uncertain to call.",
    "biggest_unknown": "Whether the \u00a336 billion represents genuinely new spending or largely repackages already-planned projects \u2014 if mostly repackaged, the real-terms relief to household transport costs is negligible.",
    "claims": [
